 "accommodation": {
  "name": "Villa el Cano",
  "blurb": "Back to Villa el Cano for “The Villa Return”, this time with twenty tourists filling all ten bedrooms. Alferini, Los Flamingos (which the villa overlooks) and San Roque New made up the three rounds.\n\nVilla el Cano is a ten-bedroom private estate above Puerto Banús on the Marbella coast, in a gated community overlooking Los Flamingos golf club, with views across the countryside to the Mediterranean. It has heated indoor and outdoor pools, a sauna and jacuzzi, a tennis court, a putting green, an outdoor bar and BBQ area, and air-conditioned en-suite bedrooms throughout.",
